   "stem_html": "Radioactive deoxythymidine triphosphate is supplied to the protist Euglena to use for replication. After an interval of time, the cells are homogenized and different fractions are analyzed for radioactivity content in large nucleic acid molecules. Which fraction of the cells will not be radioactively labeled?",
